Icons derived from Feather Icons (MIT License)
-----------------------------------------------

The following SpartaCSS icon names currently ship geometry confirmed, by
direct path-data comparison, to be derived from Feather Icons
(https://github.com/feathericons/feather):

  external-link, trending-up, trending-down, award, paper-clip, send,
  image, rss, file-text, list-view, chart-bar, table-2

(`table-2` is sourced from the Lucide repository but is itself classified
by Lucide's own LICENSE file as derived from Feather; it is MIT-licensed
under Feather's terms, not Lucide's ISC terms — see the `shield-check`
note below for the one icon that mixes both.)

