Dual-source icon: shield-check
--------------------------------

SpartaCSS's `shield-check` icon is a composite: its outer shield body is
confirmed derived from Feather's own `shield` icon (MIT, Cole Bemis —
license text above); its inner checkmark is confirmed derived from
Lucide's current `shield-check` icon, which is a Lucide-original glyph,
not one of Lucide's Feather-derived icons (ISC, Lucide Icons and
Contributors — license text above). Both license blocks above apply to
this single icon, covering its two components separately.

