Removal condition
------------------

Each entry in this file is to be deleted at the time its named icon's
independently constructed RedSpartan replacement (per
[`docs/design/icon-standard.md`](docs/design/icon-standard.md)) is
integrated into `src/`. When every entry has been removed, this file is
to be deleted entirely rather than kept as an empty placeholder.
